    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 17,
    "quick_answer": "Usually not. CHAMPVA is for a Veteran's family, and Veterans get their own care through VA health care. The exceptions: a Veteran married to a qualifying Veteran can qualify as that Veteran's spouse or survivor, and a Veteran approved as a Primary Family Caregiver may qualify through the caregiver program. Parents can only qualify through that caregiver route.",
