    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "for-therapists",
    "sort_order": 1,
    "quick_answer": "Yes, in private practice and many contractor arrangements. Most agency, hospital, and W-2 group jobs set your hours or require certain shifts. Even with full control, continuity of care limits how much you can change once clients depend on a regular time slot.",
    "in_practice_markdown": null,
    "reviewed_by": "ValorWell",
