    "quick_answer": "Yes. CHAMPVA pays any provider licensed by the state for the service and working within their scope, which includes independently licensed LPCs, LMHCs, LMFTs, LCSWs, and psychologists. VA Community Care uses counselors, marriage and family therapists, social workers, and psychologists who are credentialed with the regional network or hold a Veterans Care Agreement.",
