    "quick_answer": "After a car accident or other injury someone else may be responsible for, bill that insurance first, whether it's yours or the other person's. Once it sends an explanation of benefits, CHAMPVA may pay the remaining covered balance. VA may also send Form 10-7959D asking about the accident, because federal law lets VA recover its costs from whoever is responsible.",
