    "quick_answer": "Form 1095-B is a tax form showing you had health coverage, and CHAMPVA counts. You don't need to file it with your federal tax return, but some states ask for proof of coverage. VA stopped mailing it automatically in 2026. To get one, call CHAMPVA at 800-733-8387 and ask for a paper copy.",
