    "quick_answer": "Possibly. CHAMPVA isn't available to anyone eligible for or enrolled in TRICARE. Under federal law, a gray-area retiree's family is eligible for TRICARE Retired Reserve while the sponsor is covered by it, so the answer depends on enrollment and what DEERS shows. When the sponsor turns 60, the family becomes TRICARE eligible and CHAMPVA ends.",
