    "quick_answer": "CHAMPVA doesn't cover care for a work-related injury or illness when workers' compensation or a similar plan is payable, even if you never filed a workers' comp claim. Once those benefits run out, CHAMPVA may cover the care if it's otherwise covered. VA may send Form 10-7959D asking about the injury.",
