    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 2,
    "quick_answer": "For most CHAMPVA decisions, you have 1 year from the date on the decision letter to request a Higher-Level Review or a Board Appeal. A Supplemental Claim with new and relevant evidence can be filed anytime. A preauthorization denial gives you 1 year to send a written clinical appeal. If your decision letter states a different deadline, follow the letter.",
