    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 6,
    "quick_answer": "Before you apply, gather the Veteran's and each applicant's basic details, copies of both sides of any insurance or Medicare cards, and the relationship documents that fit your family. Some documents are only needed in certain situations, like adoption papers or a school letter. Others, like a marriage certificate, are optional but speed things up.",
