    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 3,
    "quick_answer": "For most covered outpatient care, you pay 25% of CHAMPVA's allowable amount after your deductible, and CHAMPVA pays 75%. The 25% is figured from what CHAMPVA allows, not what the provider bills. It can be lower or zero if you have other insurance, if the service has no cost share, or once your family hits the $3,000 yearly cap.",
