    "quick_answer": "Yes. CHAMPVA covers insulin, testing supplies, and syringes, even over-the-counter ones. It also covers CGM supplies, insulin pumps with a doctor's order, a yearly eye exam, diabetes education, limited foot care, and diabetic shoes. Diabetes drugs are covered for diabetes, but GLP-1s aren't covered for weight loss. Meds by Mail supplies are free if you qualify.",
