    "quick_answer": "If CHAMPVA owes you money back, VA will only pay it by direct deposit. Family members set this up through VA's Financial Services Center portal using the Vendor File form, VA Form 10091, not the regular VA.gov profile. Setup and the claim are separate, so file the claim on time even if direct deposit isn't finished.",
