    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 9,
    "quick_answer": "CHAMPVA covers medically necessary doctor and specialist visits, office procedures, and related tests from any qualified provider. You don't need a referral. When CHAMPVA is your only coverage, you pay your yearly deductible, then 25% of CHAMPVA's allowable amount. The office should usually bill CHAMPVA for you under payer ID 84146.",
