    "quick_answer": "A child under 18 can qualify for CHAMPVA if they're the child of a qualifying Veteran and aren't eligible for TRICARE. Birth children, adopted children, and stepchildren can all count. For a newborn, get a Social Security number, add the baby as the Veteran's dependent, then apply. CHAMPVA can't pay the baby's bills until the baby is enrolled.",
