    "quick_answer": "A caregiver can get CHAMPVA only as the designated Primary Family Caregiver in VA's PCAFC program, and only if they don't have other health coverage. VA enrolls qualifying caregivers automatically. If you later get other insurance, like an employer plan or Medicare, you'll usually lose this CHAMPVA, so tell CHAMPVA and your Caregiver Support team.",
