    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 3,
    "quick_answer": "A spouse can qualify for CHAMPVA when VA has rated the Veteran permanently and totally (P&T) disabled from a service-connected condition. The marriage has to be recognized by VA, and the spouse can't be eligible for TRICARE. Coverage starts on the effective date printed on the CHAMPVA ID card.",
