    "quick_answer": "Yes. CHAMPVA covers medically necessary outpatient surgery at surgery centers and hospital outpatient departments. At an ambulatory surgery center, the facility bill has no deductible and a 25% cost share. Surgeons, anesthesia, and other doctors bill separately, and their bills follow the usual deductible and 25%. Surgery itself doesn't need preauthorization unless the procedure does.",
