    "quick_answer": "CHAMPVA doesn't cover routine foot care like toenail trimming or corn and callus removal, unless it's needed because a diagnosed systemic disease affects your legs and feet, such as severe diabetes or circulation or nerve disease. Other medically necessary foot treatment from a podiatrist can be covered. Diabetic shoes follow a separate rule.",
