    "quick_answer": "CHAMPVA excludes cosmetic surgery, meaning surgery mainly to change appearance without fixing a bodily function. It may cover limited reconstructive surgery, like repairing a serious birth defect, restoring form or function after an accident, revising severe cancer surgery scars, or breast reconstruction after a covered mastectomy. Documentation of the medical purpose matters most.",
