    "quick_answer": "Meds by Mail, care at a VA facility through CITI, hospice, listed preventive care, and certain birth control and sterilization services have no CHAMPVA deductible and no cost share. Inpatient stays, ambulatory surgery centers, and partial psychiatric day programs skip the deductible, but you may still owe a cost share. Check both rules separately.",
