    "published_at": "2026-09-22T04:36:27.448875+00:00",
    "public_updated_at": "2026-10-14T18:43:18.988338+00:00",
    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 4,
    "quick_answer": "CHAMPVA doesn't cover nonsurgical weight-loss care, including weight-loss medications and programs. GLP-1 drugs prescribed for weight loss aren't covered, but some are covered for type 2 diabetes, sleep apnea, MASH, or heart risk. Bariatric surgery may be covered for a BMI over 40, or over 35 with serious related conditions.",
