    "quick_answer": "Yes, for a limited time. If a full-time student between 18 and 23 has to stop school because of a disabling illness or injury, CHAMPVA can continue. It lasts until the earliest of: 6 months after the disability ends, 2 years after it started, or the student's 23rd birthday.",
