    "quick_answer": "Yes. CHAMPVA covers physical, occupational, and speech therapy when it's medically necessary skilled treatment for a covered condition, from a licensed provider. Routine outpatient therapy doesn't need preauthorization. General exercise programs, gym memberships, and school or job training aren't covered. Long courses of therapy may be reviewed, so treatment plans and progress notes matter.",
