    "quick_answer": "It depends on the care. Since August 2025, VA issues one-year authorizations for 30 common types of care, including outpatient mental health and many specialties. Others may be shorter. Your letter shows the end date and any visit limit. When you need more, your community provider sends VA a Request for Service, VA Form 10-10172, before the authorization runs out.",
