    "quick_answer": "Routine and maintenance prescriptions from a Community Care provider go to the VA pharmacy at your referring VA facility, usually by mail, and follow VA's National Formulary. Medications you need right away can be filled at an in-network retail pharmacy for up to 14 days, with no refills. You pay nothing at the pharmacy; VA bills any copay later.",
