    "quick_answer": "Apply for a free individual (Type 1) NPI through CMS's NPPES website and choose the taxonomy code that matches your license. Then create a CAQH ProView profile, which many insurers use for credentialing, upload your documents, authorize payers to view it, and re-attest regularly.",
