    "quick_answer": "To add someone to CHAMPVA, you file a new CHAMPVA application for that person, online or on VA Form 10-10d. Updating an existing application won't add them. Newborns need a Social Security number and to be added as the Veteran's dependent first. Adopted children need adoption papers, and stepchildren need proof of the Veteran's marriage to their parent.",
