    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 1,
    "quick_answer": "If CHAMPVA denies preauthorization for care that hasn't happened yet, send a written clinical appeal with any new medical information and a copy of the denial to VFMP Appeals, PO Box 600, Spring City, PA 19475. If that's denied, you can ask for a second-level review. Completed care goes a different route.",
