    "quick_answer": "Refill online through VA's prescription tool, by calling the automated line at 888-370-1699, or by mailing the bar-coded refill slip. Online and phone refills can take up to 10 days, mail up to 15. If the prescription expired or has no refills left, that's a renewal: call Meds by Mail and ask for one.",
