    "quick_answer": "If you have CHAMPVA and no other prescription coverage, have your prescriber e-prescribe to \"Meds by Mail CHAMPVA,\" pharmacy ID 5204437. You can also mail an original 90-day prescription to Meds by Mail, PO Box 331178, Murfreesboro, TN 37133. New prescriptions can take up to 21 days, so get a short local supply to bridge the gap.",
