    "quick_answer": "Most therapy claim problems come from eligibility, authorization, coding, other-insurance, or data errors, and most are fixable. Check status before resubmitting, correct and resubmit rejected claims, and appeal true denials with records. In solo practice, the cash-flow hit is yours; in other settings, the contract decides.",
