    "quick_answer": "Legitimate oversight protects clients and the organization: compliance reviews, documentation standards, supervision for pre-licensed clinicians, and quality improvement. Micromanagement controls how a licensed clinician does clinical work without a clinical reason, such as scripted sessions, mandated frequencies, or constant monitoring. The test is whether the rule serves clients or just control.",
