    "quick_answer": "Each state names its counselor licenses, so the same profession goes by LPC, LPCC, LMHC, LCPC, LCMHC, and other titles. What matters for insurance is the level: payers generally pay independently licensed counselors, not associate or supervised licenses. Check your state board to see which title is the independent one.",
