    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 7,
    "quick_answer": "It isn't automatically denied. If CHAMPVA turns out to be the payer and the claim is filed within one year, CHAMPVA reviews the care for medical necessity after the fact. That review can still say no. First, check whether approval was really needed. Care through CITI, care your other insurance approved, and emergencies are often exceptions.",
