    "quick_answer": "Many organizations chase notes because late documentation delays billing and creates compliance risk. That's a real problem, but nagging, write-ups, and pay holds damage trust. A better model ties pay to completed notes, so clinicians control their own timing and accountability sits with them, not with someone checking up on them.",
