    "quick_answer": "First, figure out your status. Non-exempt W-2 employees must be paid for all hours worked, including documentation. Exempt salaried employees and contractors usually aren't paid by the hour, so the fix is reducing the work: better tools, protected time, fewer admin tasks, or a setting that takes billing off your plate.",
