    "quick_answer": "If you're enrolled in VA health care and have had VA or VA-approved care in the past 24 months, you can go to an in-network urgent care or walk-in clinic without a referral. You pay nothing at the visit. Priority Groups 1 to 5 get three free visits a year, then $30 each.",
