    "quick_answer": "VA health care is care VA provides or pays for, not an insurance plan. Community Care is part of it: VA approves and pays for certain care from outside providers. Private insurance is separate, and you can keep it. VA may bill it for care not related to your service-connected conditions, but you won't owe more because of it.",
