    "quick_answer": "An authorized CHAMPVA provider is any doctor, therapist, facility, or supplier that's licensed or certified by the state to provide the service, working within that license. If the state doesn't license that kind of provider, national certification can count. There's no CHAMPVA network to join. Being authorized is separate from accepting assignment, preauthorization, and coverage.",
