    "quick_answer": "Usually nothing, unless VA sends a letter asking for more information. If it does, add what it asks for to your existing application instead of starting over. Update the same application if your address, insurance, or school status changes. If you're approved, VA mails a welcome letter and a CHAMPVA ID card, which can take up to 6 weeks.",
