    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "champva",
    "sort_order": 15,
    "quick_answer": "A child who has CHAMPVA because they're a Veteran's dependent loses it on the date they marry. That's true whether they're under 18, a student, or an adult child disabled before 18. A divorce doesn't bring it back. Coverage can only come back in narrow cases where VA treats the marriage as void or annulled.",
