    "resource_kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "va-community-care",
    "sort_order": 2,
    "quick_answer": "Ask your VA care team for help. VA says to contact them if the provider you want isn't in the network or no in-network provider meets your needs. Options include the provider joining the network, VA finding another network provider, or VA signing a direct Veterans Care Agreement. None is guaranteed.",
