    "quick_answer": "Don't pay it right away, and don't ignore it. First confirm the care was authorized: right provider, right dates, right services. Then call the provider's billing office with your authorization number and ask them to bill VA. If the bill doesn't get fixed, call VA's Community Care contact center at 877-881-7618. VA also has help if a bill reaches collections.",
