    "quick_answer": "A covered Veteran is the first requirement for VA Community Care. You're covered if you're enrolled in VA health care, or if you aren't enrolled but fall into one of three groups, such as being rated 50% or more service connected. You still need to meet an eligibility rule and get VA's approval.",
