    "quick_answer": "Because many Veterans and military family members won't bring it up on their own. Asking every new client \"Have you or someone close to you ever served in the military?\" gives you clinical context and can open doors to VA care, CHAMPVA, Vet Centers, and crisis resources the client didn't know about.",
