    "quick_answer": "No. CHAMPVA excludes services or supplies prescribed or provided by a member of your immediate family, or by anyone living in your household or the Veteran's household. That's true even if they're a licensed nurse, doctor, or therapist. Family can still help with care, but CHAMPVA won't pay for it.",
